# Workflow
- One session = one task from docs/tasks.md: /plan T-NNN -> human
  approves -> /clear -> /build -> /check -> /ship -> /clear -> /go.
- One plan step = one commit; body carries "T-NNN US-NNN".
- Typecheck after any series of code changes.
- Found something outside the task? New T-NNN line or Q-NN — never fix "by the way".
- Branches: feat/*, fix/*; conventional commits; PR via gh; humans merge.

